        {"source": "spec", "quote": "two isolated CAN buses (CAN0, CAN1)"}
      ],
      "impact": "Isolation is defeated; ground loops and noise can couple between logic and bus sides, defeating the purpose of isolated CAN.",
      "confidence": 0.9
